    <!-- ─── 法律免责声明 ─── -->
    <string name="disc_title">LEGAL WARNING</string>
    <string name="disc_body">This app is for authorized security research and education only.\n\nWhat the platform actually does (the UI never claims more):\n\n▸ Wi-Fi: creates a LOCAL SoftAP hotspot / rotates the local hotspot SSID only. No deauth or beacon frame injection, no disconnecting other people\'s devices; starting a hotspot may also interrupt this device\'s Wi-Fi.\n▸ BLE: only broadcasts spoofed vendor advertisements, which may cause pairing or continuity prompts on nearby devices. It cannot suppress or disconnect devices; the effect depends on the receiving OS and version.\n▸ Bluetooth discovery: only scans nearby classic Bluetooth devices locally. It never interferes with other devices.\n▸ 802.11 frame injection / deauthentication requires root + a specific chipset and firmware. The app probes capabilities at runtime and shows a clear \'unsupported on this system\' message instead of a fake executable option.\n\nBy using this app you confirm that:\n\n▸ Disrupting networks or devices that are not yours is illegal\n▸ You will only test in environments you own or have written authorization for\n▸ The developer assumes no liability for damages caused by misuse of this tool\n\nUse it responsibly.</string>
